{"html": "<div class=\"framer-80p7pi\" data-framer-name=\"Plans Cards\" style=\"--1in4u97: column; --1pf74k9: 100%; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><div class=\"framer-141xl84\" data-border=\"true\" data-framer-name=\"Plan Card\" style=\"--border-bottom-width: 1px; --border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); --border-left-width: 1px; --border-right-width: 1px; --border-style: solid; --border-top-width: 1px; background-color: var(--token-cdfc1154-0600-4560-a58f-23c5d7362a76, rgb(250, 250, 250)); will-change: transform; border-radius: 2.75862% / 1.90985%; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 20px, 0px); transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><div class=\"framer-tivwwd\" data-border=\"true\" data-framer-name=\"Header\" style=\"--border-bottom-width: 1px; --border-color: var(--token-65cee55d-f4cd-444a-9d39-a77dc31040ee, rgb(6, 61, 48)); --border-left-width: 0px; --border-right-width: 0px; --border-style: solid; --border-top-width: 0px; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><div class=\"framer-1n6ubub\" data-framer-name=\"Name &amp; Description\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1sokxc0\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-15samaz\" data-styles-preset=\"UV6UY48Yn\" dir=\"auto\">Tailored Scale-Up</p></div></div><div class=\"framer-hms125\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\">Once the foundation is set, we move into execution. This is where we pitch your brand directly to buyers at Harrods, Selfridges, Waitrose, Whole Foods, and 1,500+ independents across the UK. We manage the relationships, handle the logistics readiness, and drive your brand onto shelves. The scope and investment of this phase are tailored to your brand's ambitions and the accounts we are targeting together.</p><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\"><em class=\"framer-text\">Retainer structured around scope. Commission applies on all secured retail placements.</em></p></div></div><div class=\"framer-4nqbr1\" data-framer-name=\"Body\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><div class=\"framer-10s53ps\" data-framer-name=\"Features List\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><div class=\"framer-kla9vu\" data-framer-name=\"Feature Item\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><svg class=\"framer-erOAp framer-gaynet\" data-framer-name=\"Check Icon\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"--4i27ky: rgb(0, 0, 0); --b8xnka: 2; --42b6oa: 0; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1754522700\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-deo2ec\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\">Target-Account Development.                                                                                                                                                                                                                  <em class=\"framer-text\">Mapping out specific high-priority retail targets (supermarkets, high-end stores, or independent networks).</em> </p></div></div><div class=\"framer-1yap0ry\" data-framer-name=\"Feature Item\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><svg class=\"framer-erOAp framer-cmq5ju\" data-framer-name=\"Check Icon\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"--4i27ky: rgb(0, 0, 0); --b8xnka: 2; --42b6oa: 0; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1754522700\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-1gxoo4a\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\">Direct Retail Outreach &amp; Buyer Relationships.                                                                                                                                                                                                                   <em class=\"framer-text\">Actively pitching your brand to our established network of category buyers and managing the commercial negotiations.</em></p></div></div><div class=\"framer-1xq22cc\" data-framer-name=\"Feature Item\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><svg class=\"framer-erOAp framer-b398ar\" data-framer-name=\"Check Icon\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"--4i27ky: rgb(0, 0, 0); --b8xnka: 2; --42b6oa: 0; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1754522700\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-1trxedg\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\">Buyer Materials Creation.                                                                                                                                                                                                                   <em class=\"framer-text\">Designing and copywriting high-converting sales decks, sell sheets, and brand presentations tailored for UK retailers.</em></p></div></div><div class=\"framer-tawv7\" data-framer-name=\"Feature Item\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><svg class=\"framer-erOAp framer-x16lyr\" data-framer-name=\"Check Icon\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"--4i27ky: rgb(0, 0, 0); --b8xnka: 2; --42b6oa: 0; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1754522700\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-17y2bzt\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\">Sales Pipeline Foundation                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <em class=\"framer-text\">Ongoing intelligence We establish the foundations of your sales pipeline by identifying your ideal prospects, prioritising the right opportunities, and creating a structured pipeline that gives your business a clear path to early sales conversations.</em></p></div></div><div class=\"framer-1vw015m\" data-framer-name=\"Feature Item\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><svg class=\"framer-erOAp framer-rcxaqg\" data-framer-name=\"Check Icon\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"--4i27ky: rgb(0, 0, 0); --b8xnka: 2; --42b6oa: 0; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1754522700\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-dhvh99\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\">Positioning &amp; Commercial Strategy.                                                                                                                                                                                                                   <em class=\"framer-text\">Full design and execution of your long-term pricing, commercial, and channel-specific marketing strategies.</em></p></div></div><div class=\"framer-w10w5q\" data-framer-name=\"Feature Item\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><svg class=\"framer-erOAp framer-1jl3xfu\" data-framer-name=\"Check Icon\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"--4i27ky: rgb(0, 0, 0); --b8xnka: 2; --42b6oa: 0; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#1754522700\"></use></svg><div class=\"framer-15y1my9\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1elh10h\" data-styles-preset=\"NtWSAs6YA\" dir=\"auto\">Corporate Office Activations.                                                                                                                                                                                                                   <em class=\"framer-text\">Direct, physical access to London’s top corporate spaces and offices for high-impact sampling campaigns and brand activations.</em></p></div></div><div class=\"framer-1b2551e\" data-framer-name=\"Feature Item\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); transform: none; transform-origin: 50% 50% 0px;\"><svg class=\"framer-erO